{"assertion":{"kind":"theoretical","text":"Erdős Problem #564: declared status 'open'. Formalized: yes. Let $R_3(n)$ be the minimal $m$ such that if the edges of the $3$-uniform hypergraph on $m$ vertices are $2$-coloured then there is a monochromatic copy of the complete $3$-uniform hypergraph on $n$ vertices.\n\nIs there some constant $c>0$ such that\\[R_3(n) \\geq 2^{2^{cn}}?\\] Current best: Erd\\H{o}s, Hajnal, M\\'{a}t\\'{e}, and Rado \\cite{EHMR84} have proved a doubly exponential lower bound for the corresponding problem with $4$ colours. Prize: $500. Tags: graph theory, hypergraphs, ramsey theory."},"claim_id":"vcl_752b570ae13b9187ec14eae42093f7619adb0976edb109ccccf5fd21832e6de6","conditions":[],"created_at":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","evidence":[],"extensions":{"vela.legacy-finding.v1":{"annotations":[],"attachments":[],"confidence":{"basis":"external catalogue record","extraction_confidence":1.0,"kind":"frontier_epistemic","method":"llm_initial","score":0.5},"flags":{"contested":false,"declining":false,"gap":false,"gravity_well":false,"negative_space":false,"retracted":false},"legacy_conditions":{"duration":null,"text":""},"legacy_evidence":{"evidence_spans":[],"method":"erdos_deep","model_system":"n/a","replicated":false,"replication_count":null,"type":"theoretical"},"legacy_links":[],"legacy_provenance":{"authors":[],"doi":null,"extraction":{"extracted_at":"","extractor_version":"","method":"database_import","model":null,"model_version":null},"review":null,"source_type":"database_record","title":"erdos_deep:564","year":null},"previous_version":null,"source_schema":"https://vela.science/schema/finding-bundle/v0.10.0","source_version":1,"updated":null}},"imported_from":{"era":"finding_v0_10","object_id":"vf_79c2ef9eb8413179","object_root":"sha256:d58e2d942a3bba162f733ec0a26cca43f4c6c48c07fe3d3f7af2d18f802f23de","predecessor_commit":"c236b4fdedb25e0d726e24e2780d50962e4844f7"},"provenance":[{"kind":"database_record","title":"erdos_deep:564"}],"relations":[],"rev